##OpenGL GLIB
Perspective 70
LookAt  0 0 3  0 0 0  0 1 0

Vertex   snake.vert
Fragment snake.frag
Program  SnakeH  			\
		uUseST <true>		\
		uIsSnake <true>     \
		amplitude <0. .5 5.>\

Color 1. 1. 1.
Obj snakeH.obj 1.0 1 1

// I am going to split the grass and snake shaders
Vertex grass.vert
Fragment grass.frag
Program Grass

QuadXZ   -0.1 100.0 128 128